'''Yarua''' was a [[Wookiee]] [[Gender|male]]<ref name="Insider 211" /> and an elder [[Politics|statesman]]<ref name="TCVDNE">''[[Star Wars: The Complete Visual Dictionary, New Edition]]''</ref> who, in the last [[Standard year|years]] of the [[Galactic Republic]], represented [[Kashyyyk]] in the [[Galactic Senate]].<ref name="HisGal" /> [[Senator]] Yarua was present in the Senate's [[Galactic Senate Chamber]], when [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Finis Valorum]] was [[Vote of No Confidence|ousted]] from the [[Office of the Chancellor|office]] following the [[Invasion of Naboo|invasion]] of the remote [[planet]] [[Naboo]], by the [[Trade Federation]].<ref name="TPM">{{Film|I}}</ref> During a [[mission to the moon of Staggec]] early in the [[Clone Wars]], Yarua was in possession of a [[Unidentified Jedi artifact|valuable item]], which he hid inside a [[Viiveenn's doll|doll]] owned by his daughter, [[Viiveenn]], when [[General]] [[Grievous]] attacked the [[moon]]. Yarua died after pushing himself and Grievous out of an [[airlock]] to save Viiveenn.<ref name="Hyperspace Stories 1" />

==Behind the scenes==
Yarua first appeared in the [[1999]] movie [[Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace|''Star Wars'': Episode I ''The Phantom Menace'']], the first installment of the ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[prequel trilogy]].<ref name="TPM" /> The original [[Chewbacca]] costume from the [[original trilogy]] was used for Yarua in film.<ref name="BC62">{{BustCollectionCite|62|Behind the Cameras}}</ref>

